{"unit_id":"jarvisluk__dsh-projectless-session#card-zh","repo":"jarvisluk/dsh-projectless-session","commit":"890518f97e7023dd8e34e5883ed2abc6fa44ebe8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-projectless-session 是面向 DSH Web 的会话插件，在工作区选择器中加入无工作区会话入口。它通过 DSH Host/Client 扩展接口，在 Documents/DSH 下创建按日期和时间组织的独立目录，并将目录临时注册为 Workspace，以保留 DSH 原生的新会话编辑器。主要功能包括创建独立会话、接受首条消息后保留会话并移除临时工作区注册、清理未使用的空白会话目录、跟随 DSH 语言设置显示中英文界面。适合希望把会话与现有项目工作区分开的 DSH Web 用户。默认无需额外账号或 API 密钥；可在插件配置中指定绝对路径作为目录根目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:294-380","src/client/session.ts:174-196","src/client/session.ts:262-300","src/host/directories.ts:30-41","src/index.ts:21-24"]}
{"unit_id":"jarvisluk__dsh-projectless-session#card-en","repo":"jarvisluk/dsh-projectless-session","commit":"890518f97e7023dd8e34e5883ed2abc6fa44ebe8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-projectless-session adds a DSH Web picker option for sessions without a project. It creates a dated local folder for DSH's native composer. After the first prompt, the session stays and the temporary Workspace is removed; unused blank sessions are cleaned up. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:294-380","src/client/session.ts:174-196","src/client/session.ts:262-300","src/host/directories.ts:30-41","src/index.ts:21-24"]}
